{"type":"text","timestamp":1778977979926,"sessionID":"ses_1cca68e57ffenFLKm879GADql2","part":{"id":"prt_e3359af50001cuzpaBRBfZnURA","messageID":"msg_e3359a6de001gTWk07E5L6Av0n","sessionID":"ses_1cca68e57ffenFLKm879GADql2","type":"text","text":"The issue is clear: rename existing `MONDO:1060194` to the updated ClinGen-preferred label and avoid keeping the original label as an exact synonym. Next I’m checking the current term stanza and any pattern implications before editing.","time":{"start":1778977976145,"end":1778977979923}}}
