sorder\ndef: \"An autoimmune lymphoproliferative syndrome that results from defective lymphocyte homoestasis, and is caused by variants in the FAS gene. It is characterized by non-malignant lymphoproliferation, autoimmune disease, and lifelong increased risk for both Hodgkin and non-Hodgkin lymphoma.\" [https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40157/]\nsubset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0028187\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nsubset: rare\nxref: GARD:0028187 {source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\nis_a: MONDO:0017979 {source=\"https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40157/\"} ! autoimmune lymphoproliferative syndrome\nintersection_of: MONDO:0017979 ! autoimmune lymphoproliferative syndrome\nintersection_of: has_material_basis_in_germline_mutation_in http://identifiers.org/hgnc/11920 ! FAS\nrelationship: has_material_basis_in_germline_mutation_in http://identifiers.org/hgnc/11920 {source=\"https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40157/\"} ! FAS\nrelationship: predisposes_towards MONDO:0004952 {source=\"https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40157/\"} ! Hodgkins lymphoma\nrelationship: predisposes_towards MONDO:0018908 {source=\"https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40157/\"} ! non-Hodgkin lymphoma\nproperty_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7638-4659\nproperty_value: IAO:0000233 \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9749\" xsd:anyURI\n\n","exit":0,"description":"Verify checked in MONDO term","truncated":false},"title":"Verify checked in MONDO term","time":{"start":1778978024903,"end":1778978024908}},"id":"prt_e335a68d4001CQR0oT0X9qMfKc","sessionID":"ses_1cca68e57ffenFLKm879GADql2","messageID":"msg_e335a6472001Jh0MNQ5emxb2pR"}}
